{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "CloudFlare Workers快速使用攻略",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b390",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "CloudFlare-Workers快速使用攻略",
        "level": 1
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "CloudFlare Workers是众多Serverless服务中的一种，同样的还有Netlify，Vercel等大厂提供的各式后端服务，这些后端服务的特点是弹性扩容，无数据库，但是最重要的是",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "免费",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "！",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b391",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "这些Serverless服务都能运行Node.js代码，并作为独立的接口运行，好消息是免费的额度基本够用，坏消息是因为并非完整的服务器环境，因此无法部署其他的服务，例如数据库等，由于Stateless特性，也无法用于保存数据，实现聊天系统等依赖上下文的功能，但是作为分发服务却十分好用，尤其是例如前端SSR项目，纯粹的API转发等，能够快速部署上线。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b392",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "以CloudFlare Workers为例，它提供了许多免费Workers实例额度供个人开发者使用，并且相比起其他家的服务，它的API可访问性更高，在内地也能正常访问，因此更适合面向国内用户使用。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b393",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "起步",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b394",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b394",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "要使用CloudFlare Workers首先需要注册一个CloudFlare账号，注册是完全免费的。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b395",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "在CloudFlare管理后台，可以找到Workers & Pages栏目，在这里可以管理自己的所有Workers。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b396",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果只是简单的Node.js项目，直接通过CloudFlare的管理后台上传服务代码即可。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b397",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "addEventListener(\"fetch\", (event) => {\n  event.respondWith(new Response(\"hello cloudflare worker\"));\n});",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b398",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "可以看到Worker的核心代码是",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "addEventListener(\"fetch\")",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " ，用于处理服务器收到的请求，这也是大多数Serverless服务都提供的功能，基于此我们就可以实现一个简单的Node.js服务器。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b399",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "工程化",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b400",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b400",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果想要稍微正式点的对项目进行迭代，本地开发和Git管理必不可少，CloudFlare也提供了对应的工具协助进行本地开发，即",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "Wrangler",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://www.npmjs.com/package/wrangler",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，这是一个命令行工具，可以模拟Workers的线上运行环境，在本地进行开发。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b401",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "# 新建项目\nnpx wrangler init my-worker",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b402",
      "props": {
        "language": "bash"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "通过Wrangler新建项目后，会自动生成wrangler.toml配置文件，里面指定了当前Worker的名称、入口文件等。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b403",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "第一次使用wrangler命令需要登录",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b405",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b404",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Cloudflare Worker支持Typescript文件，因此你可以直接编写index.ts进行开发。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b406",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "使用Hono",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b407",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b407",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "手动写路由处理函数会比较复杂，推荐使用",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "Hono",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://www.npmjs.com/package/hono",
          "type": "link"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "进行开发，它提供了类似于Koa.js的API抽象，并且提供了多家Serverless服务提供商的支持，抹平了一些不同环境的API差异。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b408",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "环境变量",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b409",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b409",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "有时我们需要将密钥等敏感数据保存到环境变量中防止泄漏，可以使用wrangler自带的命令将变量传输到CloudFlare控制台中：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b410",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "wrangler secret put CLIENT_ID\nwrangler secret put CLIENT_SECRET",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b411",
      "props": {
        "language": "bash"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "如果想在本地开发时使用测试用的环境变量，需要使用",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": ".dev.vars",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "文件",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b412",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "CLIENT_ID=xxx\nCLIENT_SECRET=xxxxxxx",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b413",
      "props": {
        "language": "plaintext"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "可以在代码中这样调用环境变量：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b414",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "// 直接使用\nconst client_id = CLIENT_ID;\nconst client_secret = CLIENT_SECRET;\n\n// 使用Hono\napp.get('/', (ctx) => {\n\tconst { CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET } = ctx.env;\n});",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b415",
      "props": {
        "language": "typescript"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "部署",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b416",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b416",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "开发完成后也可以使用wrangler一键部署",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b417",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "wrangler deploy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b418",
      "props": {
        "language": "json"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "结合Github使用",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b419",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "结合Github",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "有时会希望使用Github Actions来自动部署Workers，这当然也没问题。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b420",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "要使用Github Actions部署项目，首先需要创建Actions配置文件",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b421",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "# .github/actions/deploy.yaml\nname: Deploy Worker\non:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - main\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 60\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: Build & Deploy Worker\n        uses: cloudflare/wrangler-action@v3\n        with:\n          apiToken: ${{ secrets.CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN }}\n          accountId: ${{ secrets.CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID }}",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b422",
      "props": {
        "language": "yaml"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "然后需要在Github中配置对应的Action Secrets：",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "和",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b423",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "其中",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 需要在Cloudflare控制台生成：",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "新建API tokens",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens",
          "type": "link"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b424",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "在生成token时，选择对应的模版即可（Workers & Pages)，生成的token同样只能查看一次。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b425",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 则是你的Cloudflare账号ID，一般来说进入控制台首页后，网页链接末尾的一串数字就是账号ID，也可以在Workers & Pages首页的侧边栏找到",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b426",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "其他",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b427",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b427",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "部署完成后，通过控制台可以看到当前服务的运行情况，可以查看日志等，也可以重新调整Worker的访问链接。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b428",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_3ab6933f2285244e23629651_b429",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
